phrase: compare sequence against last scaling by {factor}
slot: factor int
test: list=2,10,3,8 factor=3
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="scaled 2 items against last" errors=0 n=4 res=[6,10,9,8] cache=0 hits=0
