phrase: adjust non prime items safely using {fallback}
slot: fallback int
test: list=2,4,5,6 fallback=0
expect: => i=2 r=0.0 ok=true s="safely retried 2 non primes" errors=0 n=4 res=[2,0,5,0] cache=0 hits=0
