phrase: apply recursive limit {bound} storing states in cache
slot: bound int
test: list=20,40 bound=10
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="recursive bound reductions: 3" errors=0 n=2 res=[10,10] cache=2 hits=0
test: list=8,16 bound=5
